    "problemStatement": "CBO offers limited direct outreach to members and staff",
    "problemDescription": "CBO produces cost estimates and analysis that shape major legislative decisions, but members and staff outside of budget and appropriations committees often do not know what assistance CBO can provide or how to request it. Outreach is concentrated among a small set of offices with existing relationships to CBO analysts. Offices without those relationships get less help understanding or using CBO's work.",
