    "problemStatement": "Member offices choose furniture from a limited, dated catalog",
    "problemDescription": "The CAO's current furniture and layout options for member office space were not designed around how offices actually work today, including hybrid meetings, flexible staffing, and space for constituent visits. Offices that want a different configuration have little beyond the standard catalog to draw on.",
    "solutionStatement": "Broader CAO menu of modern office templates",
    "solutionDescription": "The CAO builds out a wider menu of furniture options and layout templates for member office space, designed around modern and flexible use. Offices choose the configuration that fits how they actually work instead of defaulting to a narrow standard set.",
