    "problemStatement": "Committees produce hearing records by hand, one committee at a time",
    "problemDescription": "Each committee manages its own hearing records, from transcripts to witness materials, without a shared process or system. GPO has the printing and archiving expertise to standardize this but has not been asked to build a common process, so committees duplicate the same manual work independently.",
    "solutionStatement": "GPO builds a standard hearing records automation process",
